rem Sum of Squares of Unitary Divisors
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=429

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli
arg N integer = 100000000

rem Unitary divisors take each prime
rem power of N! wholly or not at all.
rem Only primes up to sqrt N need
rem higher terms of Legendre's sum.
Mod = 1000000009
Primes = primes to N copy
Exponents = N // Primes
Root = N isqrt
Small = Primes at most Root indices
Bases = Primes Small
Powers = Bases * Bases
Extra = Bases * 0
if Small len greater 0
  for Powers min at most N
    Extra += N // Powers
    Powers = Powers * Bases min (N + 1)
  end
end
Exponents Small += Extra
Powers = 2 * Exponents
Values = Primes Powers Mod powmod
Terms = Values + 1
Answer = Terms reduce * with 1 mod Mod
Answer print
